WEBVTT

00:00:15.845 --> 00:00:22.845
Tell me
nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me
I don't understand anything, but

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:30.015
You say
itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say
those kinds of words, too

00:00:30.995 --> 00:00:37.765
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way where
we only pass each other by

00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:44.905
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.205 --> 00:00:50.735
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:51.045 --> 00:00:54.445
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.215 --> 00:00:59.245
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:05.085
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.325 --> 00:01:08.855
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:14.395
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:34.675
Capitol of Illusion

00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:40.825
Again?

00:01:41.065 --> 00:01:42.255
How many people does this make?

00:01:42.365 --> 00:01:44.225
You don't know, doctor?

00:01:44.505 --> 00:01:49.265
All of CC Corporation staff fell.

00:01:49.475 --> 00:01:50.835
Is it because of that game?

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.395
But the research team couldn't...

00:01:53.705 --> 00:01:54.765
...find anything?

00:01:55.345 --> 00:01:56.365
I wonder...

00:01:56.845 --> 00:01:58.315
All these comatose people and...

00:01:58.415 --> 00:01:59.935
...they were all playing that game?

00:02:00.385 --> 00:02:01.615
They'd have to have some suspicions.

00:02:01.955 --> 00:02:04.045
Well, you do have a point.

00:02:04.925 --> 00:02:05.975
Games.

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.355
The effects of virtual reality
on the subconscious...

00:02:09.825 --> 00:02:12.315
...is still the subject of
analysis in various research.

00:02:12.825 --> 00:02:15.825
But this case is particularly
difficult to connect.

00:02:17.835 --> 00:02:20.165
That is the course of action,
as decided by the company.

00:02:20.465 --> 00:02:23.265
Reki, I will leave the rest to you.

00:02:24.035 --> 00:02:25.095
As you know...

00:02:25.305 --> 00:02:27.935
...Kamui followed
Balmung into that state.

00:02:28.375 --> 00:02:30.865
And with Magi in a coma...

00:02:31.145 --> 00:02:33.915
...you are the only
qualified person remaining.

00:02:34.245 --> 00:02:36.375
I can certainly understand that.

00:02:37.285 --> 00:02:38.685
It is the earnest desire of this...

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:41.085
...company that an end
be put to this affair.

00:02:41.395 --> 00:02:42.485
We are reporting the...

00:02:42.595 --> 00:02:47.055
...incidents were caused by three
elementary school students.

00:02:47.895 --> 00:02:50.955
You're not going to report
about the Wandering Al?

00:02:51.535 --> 00:02:54.095
That is why I am leaving it to you.

00:02:54.605 --> 00:02:55.935
I won't say much.

00:02:56.105 --> 00:02:58.095
You are the only qualified person.

00:02:59.505 --> 00:03:01.445
Understood. Simply...

00:03:01.545 --> 00:03:02.805
...because the incident is an incident.

00:03:03.075 --> 00:03:04.405
It's only fitting.

00:03:04.585 --> 00:03:05.305
Of course.

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:09.475
I approve the use of System
Management Clause 318.

00:03:10.115 --> 00:03:11.845
Regarding the incident...

00:03:11.885 --> 00:03:15.185
...you have full authority
over the matter.

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:16.915
Thank you.

00:03:17.895 --> 00:03:19.915
Hey, hey. Did you see the newspaper?

00:03:20.195 --> 00:03:23.325
Yeah. None of it came out.

00:03:23.465 --> 00:03:26.195
Not the truth about the
incident nor how it happened.

00:03:26.935 --> 00:03:29.695
It's even worse within CC Corporation.

00:03:30.005 --> 00:03:33.035
They're saying it's not their fault at all.

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:37.165
Well, thanks to that we
can still be in "The World".

00:03:38.115 --> 00:03:40.275
It's a hot topic on the BBS.

00:03:40.815 --> 00:03:43.115
If you're going to put it
that way, it's a hot topic...

00:03:44.385 --> 00:03:46.855
Man, no one knows the truth so...

00:03:47.155 --> 00:03:48.985
...they're saying anything they like.

00:03:49.695 --> 00:03:51.655
They're saying things
like the Cerulean...

00:03:51.925 --> 00:03:53.985
...Knights were defeated
by some cursed item.

00:03:54.065 --> 00:03:56.865
Or that they developed
a spell in the real world.

00:03:57.035 --> 00:03:59.295
Or that they all ate fugu.

00:03:59.535 --> 00:04:01.765
Or that they were all hypnotized.

00:04:02.005 --> 00:04:03.595
You guys are so carefree.

00:04:05.545 --> 00:04:06.205
Rena.

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:10.975
Well qualified?

00:04:12.215 --> 00:04:15.415
Why do I have to deal with
paperwork, press conferences...

00:04:16.115 --> 00:04:17.945
...area construction, golf
business entertainment...

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:21.215
...and telephone complaints?

00:04:26.425 --> 00:04:29.365
Compared to all that "The World" is.

00:04:32.065 --> 00:04:36.125
"The World" is much more
comfortable than reality, huh?

00:04:38.405 --> 00:04:40.435
It doesn't seem to feel that way.

00:04:42.175 --> 00:04:43.435
What are you plotting?

00:04:43.975 --> 00:04:44.375
Huh?

00:04:44.685 --> 00:04:45.975
You betrayed Balmung...

00:04:46.085 --> 00:04:47.845
...you made Kamui lose her position...

00:04:47.885 --> 00:04:50.185
...and you leaked information
to Shugo and the others.

00:04:50.955 --> 00:04:53.255
That's not something a
normal person would do.

00:04:53.925 --> 00:04:54.755
No way...

00:04:55.255 --> 00:04:57.725
...it's like you're trying
to say I'm a bad guy.

00:04:58.665 --> 00:04:59.925
What is the point of all this?

00:05:00.325 --> 00:05:03.765
Do you want to take
over Balmung's position?

00:05:04.765 --> 00:05:06.065
I've come to realize...

00:05:06.365 --> 00:05:08.025
...that the job of a
System Administrator...

00:05:08.335 --> 00:05:10.495
...is not an easy one,
after trying to be one.

00:05:11.345 --> 00:05:12.675
You... Couldn't be...

00:05:13.145 --> 00:05:14.265
Sanjuro...

00:05:14.915 --> 00:05:17.475
...I'd thank you for
overestimating me...

00:05:18.415 --> 00:05:20.545
...but I'm not a big shot.

00:05:21.315 --> 00:05:24.645
Let alone, qualified to be
a system administrator.

00:05:27.825 --> 00:05:28.985
Well then.

00:05:30.955 --> 00:05:32.115
That man.

00:05:33.465 --> 00:05:35.055
Everyone! Let's go!

00:05:35.895 --> 00:05:36.955
Where to?

00:05:37.395 --> 00:05:39.955
It should be obvious! To find Rena!

00:05:40.735 --> 00:05:41.255
Shugo...

00:05:41.575 --> 00:05:44.305
...it hasn't been that long
since our last experience.

00:05:44.605 --> 00:05:46.305
That's true but...

00:05:46.975 --> 00:05:50.105
The enemy is able to
destroy a whole area.

00:05:50.445 --> 00:05:51.605
If we're not careful...

00:05:51.645 --> 00:05:53.305
...it will be like last time.

00:05:53.815 --> 00:05:55.575
So what do we do then?

00:05:55.955 --> 00:05:58.475
First of all, we must be cool-headed.

00:05:59.985 --> 00:06:03.355
It would not be wise to just
push forward thoughtlessly.

00:06:03.825 --> 00:06:04.955
But...

00:06:05.325 --> 00:06:06.455
I understand your feelings.

00:06:06.865 --> 00:06:09.125
But, the enemy is a wandering Al.

00:06:09.935 --> 00:06:12.865
Um, I've been wondering
about this for a while.

00:06:13.265 --> 00:06:14.705
What is a wandering Al?

00:06:15.135 --> 00:06:16.195
It's garbage...

00:06:16.405 --> 00:06:18.565
...non-player character data
with its own consciousness.

00:06:19.075 --> 00:06:19.875
To think...

00:06:20.105 --> 00:06:22.335
...a non-player character
could have that much power.

00:06:22.775 --> 00:06:25.305
Think what you like,
but this is the truth.

00:06:25.745 --> 00:06:28.445
Then... Are you saying
to give up on Rena?!

00:06:28.885 --> 00:06:30.685
No! That's not it!

00:06:31.855 --> 00:06:33.845
I... saw her.

00:06:34.155 --> 00:06:36.145
Shugo!

00:06:36.825 --> 00:06:37.315
Rena.

00:06:37.695 --> 00:06:38.525
Shugo!

00:06:39.565 --> 00:06:40.825
Rena!!

00:06:40.865 --> 00:06:42.025
Shugo!

00:06:43.435 --> 00:06:44.725
Even so...

00:06:46.305 --> 00:06:50.465
I... I couldn't do a thing.

00:06:53.375 --> 00:06:54.605
That's right!

00:06:54.845 --> 00:06:56.435
We have the bracelet.

00:06:56.675 --> 00:06:58.145
With the bracelet...

00:06:58.245 --> 00:06:59.405
Not we.

00:06:59.645 --> 00:07:02.015
You're the only one
who has the bracelet.

00:07:03.185 --> 00:07:04.615
There is no going back
and redoing things.

00:07:05.125 --> 00:07:07.385
Don't forget that there
are lives at stake here.

00:07:13.865 --> 00:07:16.025
At any rate, it's late.

00:07:16.565 --> 00:07:18.725
We'll decide what to do tomorrow.

00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:41.485
These people...

00:08:11.955 --> 00:08:13.255
That time...

00:08:13.385 --> 00:08:15.945
They must have come for me.

00:08:16.725 --> 00:08:19.125
I... won't give up.

00:08:19.465 --> 00:08:21.225
Until I see everyone once again.

00:08:22.495 --> 00:08:23.655
Shugo.

00:08:31.775 --> 00:08:32.865
Rena.

00:08:49.125 --> 00:08:50.985
This healthy sleeping face...

00:08:51.895 --> 00:08:53.865
It's because Shugo was here.

00:08:54.835 --> 00:08:56.265
Right, Grunty?

00:09:38.375 --> 00:09:39.865
You're my older brother Shugo, right?

00:09:41.005 --> 00:09:43.635
C-Could you be. R... Rena?

00:09:44.115 --> 00:09:46.915
My little twin sister... Rena?

00:09:47.785 --> 00:09:49.245
Bingo!

00:09:49.385 --> 00:09:51.575
It's been a while, Shugo.

00:09:51.755 --> 00:09:54.815
Well, it's the first time
meeting in this form.

00:09:55.355 --> 00:09:57.345
I'm Rena the Heavy Blade!

00:09:58.695 --> 00:09:59.315
Rena.

00:10:03.265 --> 00:10:05.925
For sure. Even if I have to do it alone.

00:10:08.205 --> 00:10:09.435
Took you long enough.

00:10:11.005 --> 00:10:12.235
Sanjuro.

00:10:13.045 --> 00:10:15.505
For a pupil to get up
later than his master...

00:10:15.815 --> 00:10:16.835
...it's inexcusable!

00:10:20.885 --> 00:10:22.285
What are you doing?

00:10:22.485 --> 00:10:24.715
You can't train by just standing up.

00:10:27.455 --> 00:10:28.545
Right!

00:10:33.025 --> 00:10:35.295
You two off to some secret training?

00:10:37.435 --> 00:10:38.925
To level up...

00:10:39.405 --> 00:10:41.805
...you can't go for your
everyday monsters.

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:52.745
The little one wants to see Rena again.

00:10:56.015 --> 00:10:57.715
Making a lady wait...

00:10:57.985 --> 00:10:59.115
...how rude!

00:10:59.585 --> 00:11:00.715
Mireille!

00:11:03.025 --> 00:11:06.285
I want to see what
the ultra rare item is...

00:11:06.995 --> 00:11:09.055
...otherwise I'll never be
able to finish this game.

00:11:10.735 --> 00:11:11.495
Mireille.

00:11:13.035 --> 00:11:16.135
Besides, if "The World"
becomes unusable...

00:11:16.135 --> 00:11:19.305
...then all the rare items I've
collected will go to waste.

00:11:20.275 --> 00:11:22.205
Once we move out...

00:11:23.775 --> 00:11:25.145
...there's no turning back.

00:11:25.715 --> 00:11:26.975
Of course!

00:11:27.185 --> 00:11:29.945
I have no hesitations at this moment.

00:11:30.185 --> 00:11:32.675
I bought a lot of medicine.

00:11:39.395 --> 00:11:41.155
Thanks, everyone.

00:11:42.365 --> 00:11:44.925
All right! Let's go!

00:12:07.555 --> 00:12:11.515
Transcendence leads to knowledge...

00:12:15.065 --> 00:12:17.465
Here. Two to three pawn.

00:12:18.435 --> 00:12:20.065
And then 5 to 6 the bishop.

00:12:27.145 --> 00:12:27.875
I'm at a loss.

00:12:28.105 --> 00:12:30.235
But, who did you lose to?

00:12:32.315 --> 00:12:32.805
Hello.

00:12:33.445 --> 00:12:35.245
Do you need to come
into "The World"...

00:12:35.415 --> 00:12:37.685
...just to play Shogi?

00:12:38.425 --> 00:12:39.545
Especially by yourself.

00:12:40.285 --> 00:12:41.615
Leave me be.

00:12:41.955 --> 00:12:44.555
I'm already a regular user.

00:12:45.225 --> 00:12:47.095
You are a regular
user, that's for certain.

00:12:48.395 --> 00:12:49.925
Why are you here this time?

00:12:51.535 --> 00:12:53.465
I came to laugh at you.

00:12:55.035 --> 00:12:56.505
Maybe I'm kidding, though...

00:12:59.105 --> 00:13:01.375
May I ask you a question?

00:13:02.515 --> 00:13:03.845
What is the difference?

00:13:04.315 --> 00:13:06.145
Before and now?

00:13:07.115 --> 00:13:07.705
With what?

00:13:08.515 --> 00:13:10.505
What's the difference?

00:13:11.155 --> 00:13:13.555
The time when you fought
with Kite and now...

00:13:13.955 --> 00:13:15.655
...as a system administrator
that's gotten the axe?

00:13:20.065 --> 00:13:20.615
I remember...

00:13:21.265 --> 00:13:24.665
...during the first Twilight,
you were just a user, right?

00:13:27.405 --> 00:13:28.765
Yes I was.

00:13:30.375 --> 00:13:32.035
Reki, my thanks to you!

00:13:32.675 --> 00:13:34.975
Balmung, take this with you.

00:13:36.345 --> 00:13:37.535
A master key?

00:13:45.625 --> 00:13:49.985
Balmung, teleporting would
be faster than running.

00:14:01.335 --> 00:14:04.365
The Capitol of Illusion, Nebel Mond.

00:14:04.575 --> 00:14:05.635
I see.

00:14:05.675 --> 00:14:08.165
By going to the private
server's root town...

00:14:08.405 --> 00:14:10.635
...you don't have to hack
each and every gate.

00:14:11.275 --> 00:14:14.445
The area from last time is
connected to Nebel Mond.

00:14:14.715 --> 00:14:16.915
In other words,
somewhere on this server...

00:14:18.215 --> 00:14:19.685
Is Rena!

00:14:28.595 --> 00:14:30.355
A town with no people!

00:14:30.435 --> 00:14:32.025
It's too quiet.

00:14:32.565 --> 00:14:34.195
For some reason, I get a bad feeling.

00:14:34.765 --> 00:14:37.365
As long as there are
no monsters, it's good.

00:14:38.035 --> 00:14:41.835
What we think of as common
sense may not apply.

00:14:48.145 --> 00:14:49.175
That's impossible!

00:14:49.215 --> 00:14:50.985
A monster in the root town?

00:14:59.265 --> 00:15:01.625
I walked to different places...

00:15:02.195 --> 00:15:04.025
...but the only landmark appears...

00:15:04.495 --> 00:15:06.295
...to be the dungeon's entrance.

00:15:07.235 --> 00:15:10.365
This is probably an area
still under construction.

00:15:10.875 --> 00:15:13.105
The data isn't complete,
so it lacks stability.

00:15:14.105 --> 00:15:14.905
That's why I...

00:15:15.175 --> 00:15:19.305
...managed to see Shugo
fighting in another area.

00:15:22.015 --> 00:15:25.745
Because I can't release

00:15:26.085 --> 00:15:30.285
the pain of "goodbye",

00:15:31.995 --> 00:15:35.695
Even when the sunset
comes bringing darkness,

00:15:36.035 --> 00:15:40.525
I won't be discouraged.

00:15:40.635 --> 00:15:46.075
We shouldn't think that we

00:15:46.245 --> 00:15:51.005
have to fight on alone.

00:15:56.755 --> 00:16:00.415
When it looks like the stars in the sky

00:16:01.355 --> 00:16:03.725
are slowly fading from sight,

00:16:03.825 --> 00:16:06.525
Just a little bit later...

00:16:06.595 --> 00:16:10.295
A little later comes the arrival of dawn.

00:16:11.265 --> 00:16:16.135
In this world that
continues to anywhere,

00:16:16.505 --> 00:16:20.445
Right now I'm looking at you

00:16:21.175 --> 00:16:23.605
Who are about to fly even now,

00:16:23.645 --> 00:16:30.145
I'm holding brilliant
emotions and looking at you

00:16:30.355 --> 00:16:39.785
Yes, I am always near you.

00:17:01.885 --> 00:17:03.475
It's no good after all.

00:17:04.055 --> 00:17:06.285
No matter which way I
go, I end up back here.

00:17:13.225 --> 00:17:14.355
Aura?

00:17:18.165 --> 00:17:20.255
No. It's not her.

00:17:25.405 --> 00:17:26.875
Who are you?

00:17:27.005 --> 00:17:28.565
How did you get here?

00:17:29.015 --> 00:17:30.275
What is this place?

00:17:32.245 --> 00:17:33.615
Death.

00:17:36.515 --> 00:17:38.785
To transcend death...

00:17:39.255 --> 00:17:41.615
...it is important that
I understand death.

00:17:42.555 --> 00:17:43.885
What do you mean?

00:17:44.125 --> 00:17:48.285
I've been thinking
about it for a while. I...

00:17:57.005 --> 00:17:59.995
Data Drain!

00:18:03.045 --> 00:18:03.735
What?!

00:18:04.115 --> 00:18:04.945
It split!!

00:18:08.145 --> 00:18:09.305
How could it?

00:18:09.485 --> 00:18:12.185
A gimmick to defend
against the Data Drain?

00:18:12.455 --> 00:18:13.715
Dammit!

00:18:13.825 --> 00:18:15.115
Calm down, Shugo!

00:18:15.255 --> 00:18:16.455
You'll definitely get your chance!

00:18:18.865 --> 00:18:21.955
My magic's not exhausted yet!

00:18:22.835 --> 00:18:24.825
Leave the healing to me!

00:18:25.295 --> 00:18:26.025
Everyone.

00:18:26.135 --> 00:18:27.725
Shugo, here it comes!

00:18:30.705 --> 00:18:32.035
GiGan Don!

00:18:44.155 --> 00:18:45.945
Slashing at it has no effect.

00:18:46.355 --> 00:18:48.375
Physical attacks are
no good against it?

00:18:48.655 --> 00:18:49.915
We have to disable...

00:18:50.025 --> 00:18:51.255
...its splitting power, somehow.

00:18:51.855 --> 00:18:52.555
I'm!!!

00:18:53.395 --> 00:18:54.585
Shugo! Stop!

00:18:54.695 --> 00:18:55.095
Stay back!

00:18:58.835 --> 00:18:59.765
Shugo!!

00:19:03.475 --> 00:19:04.735
What's wrong with you, Sanjuro?

00:19:04.805 --> 00:19:06.235
You're here, but...

00:19:07.775 --> 00:19:08.935
Balmung!

00:19:09.145 --> 00:19:10.945
It's an all out war from here!

00:19:11.245 --> 00:19:13.375
Everyone. Rally to a new position!

00:19:14.815 --> 00:19:16.285
Come with me!

00:19:16.485 --> 00:19:17.675
H-Hey.

00:19:36.975 --> 00:19:39.165
Sanjuro! Ohka! Let's go!

00:19:46.485 --> 00:19:47.245
Mireille!

00:19:48.045 --> 00:19:49.605
LaRue Zot!

00:19:52.525 --> 00:19:53.615
Shugo, now!

00:19:55.725 --> 00:19:57.195
Don't let this chance go by!

00:19:58.425 --> 00:19:58.945
I get it!

00:20:02.765 --> 00:20:06.695
Data Drain!

00:20:26.355 --> 00:20:27.045
Rena.

00:20:29.025 --> 00:20:32.225
I see. They defeated it.

00:20:34.195 --> 00:20:36.065
Yes. Understood.

00:20:39.035 --> 00:20:40.395
I must go.

00:20:41.435 --> 00:20:43.165
G-Go where?

00:20:44.135 --> 00:20:46.105
To transcend death.

00:20:47.975 --> 00:20:49.495
W-Wait a minute!

00:20:51.145 --> 00:20:52.515
Wait!

00:20:59.825 --> 00:21:00.805
Thank you.

00:21:00.855 --> 00:21:01.825
If you were going to show up...

00:21:02.025 --> 00:21:04.655
...I would have preferred
it to be sooner.

00:21:04.995 --> 00:21:07.685
The star of the show
always shows up last.

00:21:10.795 --> 00:21:13.795
It would seem we have
no time to be happy.

00:21:18.835 --> 00:21:19.995
That's...

00:21:20.305 --> 00:21:21.635
...the Wandering Al!

00:21:24.215 --> 00:21:27.235
My name is Morti.

00:21:50.205 --> 00:21:50.575
Preview

00:21:50.575 --> 00:21:52.305
Preview
This is no event.

00:21:52.305 --> 00:21:52.375
Preview

00:21:52.375 --> 00:21:54.675
Preview
What is this hand of evil
that creeps towards us?

00:21:54.675 --> 00:21:55.175
Preview

00:21:55.175 --> 00:21:56.545
Preview
What is Morti?!

00:21:56.545 --> 00:21:56.905
What is Morti?!

00:21:57.115 --> 00:22:00.085
But I'm sure Shugo can do it!

00:22:00.485 --> 00:22:01.945
I believe in you!

00:22:02.255 --> 00:22:04.985
The End of the World

00:22:06.655 --> 00:22:17.055
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running children's
frolicking voices

00:22:17.465 --> 00:22:24.995
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:22:28.275 --> 00:22:38.705
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:22:39.025 --> 00:22:47.825
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:22:49.165 --> 00:22:59.365
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:22:59.805 --> 00:23:10.275
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:23:10.585 --> 00:23:22.485
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:23:22.835 --> 00:23:30.435
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky
